November 14 2025
Major Architectural Changes
    Refactored Installation: Retired the sudo-required system service setup.
        Installation now targets user space ($HOME/.local/share/bin−animator), requiring sudo only for optional python3 dependency installation.
        Installation is now dynamic, checking for bundled files in the execution directory rather than forcing the Downloads folder.
        File handling switched from move (mv) to copy (cp) to preserve user source files and configuration.

    System Startup: Implemented a new user systemd service unit (systemctl −−user) for reliable startup.
        Service unit now includes After=graphical−session.target, Wants=dbus.service, and WantedBy=default.target.
        Added Environment="DISPLAY=:0" and $\mathtt{Environment="XDG\_RUNTIME\_DIR=/run/user/%U"}$ to ensure correct graphical session integration.

    File Paths: Configuration file access is now relative to the application's installed directory ($HOME/.local/share/bin−animator).

 New Features

    Transitional Animation: Added support for a 5-frame animation sequence when files are moved to the trash.
        New config fields: enable_animation and animation_interval_seconds.
    Aged Bin Notifications: Implemented a new mechanism to trigger desktop notifications when the days_until_flies threshold is met.
        New config fields: enable_notification and notification_message.

